  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USAID Building Green</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aims to achieve the goal of a more environmentally friendly, affordable and technologically competitive building materials industry in Nepal that also integrates the marginalized and vulnerable communities into its market system. Provides private sector support co-financial Build Up Nepal&apos;s growth efforts and eco-brick enterprises with the aim of replacing fired bricks. The partnership also includes research and development towards developing carbon-neutral bricks.</narrative>
  </description>
